      "slug": "palm-nut-concentrate",
      "term": "Palm nut concentrate",
      "definition": "Tinned extract from boiled palm nuts, sold as Banga soup base in West African stores. It gives ofe akwu its characteristic orange colour and fruit-forward flavour."
    },
    {
      "slug": "crayfish-ground",
      "term": "Ground crayfish",
      "definition": "Dried and ground shrimp used as a seasoning throughout West African cooking. Adds a deep umami base note. Sold in small packets at African grocery stores."
    }
  ],
